  like the Democrats got 45 minutes what  it what do you expect them to do as they  attempt to that's discredit these  witnesses congressman Nunez opening  statement I think is a template they'll  raise a variety of allegations about  Ukrainian involvement in the 2016  election about the sort of Mullah report  and whether or not that indicated the  president Trump had colluded with the  Russian government during the campaign  and essentially just repeat over and  over again the names and then sort of  tag lines of these various scandals  probably in an effort to lump these new  allegations in with with the kind of  mass of scandals that have  sort of overwhelmed American politics in  the last few years

